@head
@char 233
@cycle 2
@p1 range;Intelligence?
@p2 range;Deviance?
' p3=follower id  p4=drag prev id
' p5/p6=step then scratch  p7/p8=vacated  p9/p10=cursor cell
' no walk command -- everytick would move us before the drag runs.
:think
' pick a step delta: intel roll or deviance roll picks random, else seek
